1953			def:ith-restricted-line}
1954		By Cauchy--Schwarz it suffices to bound the deficit
1955		$1 - \E \sum_b \bra{\hat\psi} T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z,z}_{b} \ot
1956		\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},Z),z}_{b} \ket{\hat\psi}$,
1957		where
1958		$T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z,z}_{b}
1959		= \sum_{f_X} T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z}_{f_X,[\mathrm{eval}_z(\cdot)=b]}$.
