1961		rewritten over the mixture of product distributions
1962		$D_{\mathrm{v},i} \times D_{\mathrm{v},j}$ with $z$ uniformly random on
1963		$\ell_Z$, and, since
1964		$T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z,z}_{b}
1965		= \E_{x \in \ell_X} \sum_a
1966		T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z}
1967		_{[\mathrm{eval}_x(\cdot)=a,\ \mathrm{eval}_z(\cdot)=b]}$,
