1969		to error $m(\sqrt{\delta_P} + \sqrt{\delta_Q})$ --- obtained by
1970		applying the error inflation of
1971		Lemma~\ref{lem:restricted-line-mixture-bounds} to the conclusion of
1972		Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-xz-lines} (transported to the sub-line distribution
1973		via Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-sublines}) and to the consistency relations of
1974		Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-10} --- the resulting quantity is close to
1975		$\E \sum_{a,b} \bra{\hat\psi}
1976		\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},X),x}_{a}
1977		\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},Z),z}_{b} \ot
1978		\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},Z),z}_{b} \ket{\hat\psi}$,
1979		which, since $\{\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},X),x}_{a}\}$ is a measurement,
1980		equals
1981		$\sum_b \bra{\hat\psi} \hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},Z),z}_{b} \ot
1982		\hat{M}^{(\mathrm{Point},Z),z}_{b} \ket{\hat\psi}
1983		\ge 1 - \sqrt{\eps}$
